invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_auth.c
catches: diff
builds: bin/diff
reason: the client drops the zero byte between the context string and the
  transcript hash from the SHA-256 signed content (RFC 9846 §4.5.2), so it
  checks every RSA-PSS and P-256 CertificateVerify over a digest no server
  signs. bin/diff hashes the spec's hs_verify_content under the scheme and
  compares that digest with hsa_hash_signed_content's.

--- old
    sha256_update(&s, (const uint8_t *)ctx, sizeof ctx);
--- new
    sha256_update(&s, (const uint8_t *)ctx, sizeof ctx - 1);
